            <history xml:id="history_257N201C4">
               <p xml:id="idm137">The song was also printed in the collection "Hartmann's Melodier with the following footnote: "In Ernst Bojesen's 'Juleroser' (Christmas Roses) 1881 a competition for the best Christmas song text was announced to which Hartmann promised to compose music. They received fifty-one contributions of which the present one by telegraphist O.P. Ritto, won the prize.".</p>
            </history>
